n their way to Gurao, but when Diego is the lowest Kaz and the gang conjure up a plan to cheer him up at their next race. Will their plan fail or succeed in cheering up Diego or will it make things worse?"},{"title":"Diego`s Awakening","synopsis":"With the help of his friends, Diego discovers just how good a racer he can be."},{"title":"Gurao`s Tiger","synopsis":"The racers arrive on Gurao and need to pass a entrance exam to begin studying in Gurao. Who will pass the entrance exam and get a spot in the Top 10?"},{"title":"Demon Instructor Dile","synopsis":"The racers enter their training for a spot in Team Gurao with a new coach, Coach Dile. The coach makes the racers hungry and tired. Are the racers willing to give up, or will they survive the training course?"},{"title":"Horror! The Mysterious Desert Island","synopsis":"When Coach Dile dumps the team and their rivals from the academy on a deserted island, will they come through without giving up?"},{"title":"The Dragon Of Destruction Arrives","synopsis":"When the mysterious Ryu Kaizel appears in Gurao Training area and Dradd get over worked, what will be the outcome of the race against the team?"},{"title":"Dragon-Tiger Clash!"},{"title":"Zero And Taiga"},{"title":"Scout! Scout! Scout!"},{"title":"The Howling Golden Wolf"},null,{"title":"The Graduation Race Begins"},{"title":"Show Race"},{"title":"Fire and Ice"},{"title":"Soar Out to Space!"},{"title":"The Path to the Grand Prix"},{"title":"Falgor Breaks Through"},{"title":"The Evolution of Team JET"},{"title":"Magic! Witchcraft! Major Melee!"},null,{"title":"Ghost Racer"},{"title":"Wolver, the Flash"},{"title":"Race Kingdom"},{"title":"Revival, Antares"},null,{"title":"Wild Cats"},{"title":"The Enemy is JET"},{"title":"A New World"},{"title":"Last Chance - Putting it All on the Line!"},{"title":"Brothers, Torn Apart"},{"title":"The Eternally Passionate Guys"},null,null,{"title":"Eve of the Final Grand Prix","synopsis":"It is the day before the Final Grand Prix and Team J.E.T. is still attending functions. Today their first function attending the opening ceremony for the brand new Scan2Go stadium on Earth built to host the Final Grand Prix. The President of Earth, the Governor of Earth, and Team J.E.T. are cutting the ribbon.\r\nIn the meantime the other Gurao graduates and 'Final Grand Prix qualifiers are converging on Earth along with countless number of fans and those lucky enough to have tickets to see the race in person.\r\nHow does Team J.E.T. and their friend spend the last day before the The Final Grand Prix? Tune in and find out!"},{"title":"Start of the Final Grand Prix","synopsis":"Thirty two Scan2Go racers from across the Universe qualified for the Space Championship: The Final Grand Prix race held this time around on Earth. The first round consists of four races of eight racers each. The top three in each group advance to the second and final round. The winner of the second round (12 racers) becomes the official number one racer in the Universe!\r\nGrand Master Hipopo is the chairman of the event. We learn from his opening speech over half of the qualified racers are rookies to the Final Grand Prix. They will inject a lot of new fresh talent into the event.\r\nMeanwhile Ryu Kaizel is on his way to Earth blowing through a small star in what looks to be a fire ball comet.\r\nAdvancing to the second round from this group of eight are: King Kraken, Space Pirate Hebina, and Team J.E.T. member Fiona Ryder."},null,{"title":"Where the Light Shines"},{"title":"Challengers to the Future"},{"title":"The Beginning of the End"},null,{"title":"The Checkered Flag of Victory!"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
